a few of those dragons.

169
00:11:30,540 --> 00:11:31,370
That's really cool.

170
00:11:31,453 --> 00:11:33,220
Six Kulevos for one dragon.

171
00:11:33,460 --> 00:11:34,480
One at a time.

172
