someone's out to sabotage my new tournament.

212
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:24,800
But mark my words, this punk
will be found and punished!

213
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:26,381
In the meantime,

214
00:13:26,560 --> 00:13:30,377
