the tournament registration tonight.

215
00:13:30,460 --> 00:13:33,397
We can't afford any more
unexpected interruptions.

216
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:38,540
The only attacks this week should be
in the Kaiba Dome. Yes, sir. Of course.

217
