and TV network we could think of.

225
00:14:11,420 --> 00:14:14,657
Tell those reporters something
and the whole world hears it.

226
00:14:14,740 --> 00:14:15,570
Ha-ha!

227
00:14:15,653 --> 00:14:17,180
Hi, world, Tristan here.

228
