239
00:14:43,180 --> 00:14:47,000
I'd recognize that adorable
spiky hair anywhere! Uh, thanks?

240
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:49,840
The name is Vivian Wong, but call me Viv.

241
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:51,260
Uh, hi, Viv!

242
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:54,200
Let go of him Listen,

243
00:14:54,440 --> 00:14:57,997
I know once the competition starts You
