But that doesn't mean we can't be
buddies When we're off the playing field

245
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:04,304
You're a quiet one, aren't you?

246
00:15:06,740 --> 00:15:10,799
Hey, break it up Yeah, you might
want to let him come up for air, Viv

247
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:14,060
